1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,740
This lake suddenly turned pink...

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,000
...and it was created by a rock from space!

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:08,580
This is Lonar Lake in Maharashtra:
a giant crater, blasted out by a meteorite.

4
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,480
Its water is salty and alkaline...

5
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:13,320
and in 2020, tiny microbes turned it pink.

6
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:18,540
Ancient temples line its shore...
and legend says Lord Vishnu slew the demon Lonasura here.

7
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:22,830
Space, science and faith, in one lake!
Follow World Unscripted.
